    "document_class": "statement",
    "text_excerpt": "September 17, 2026\nKANNON MANUFACTURING INC\n5129 VESTA FARLEY RD\nFORT WORTH, TX 76119\nRegarding Account #:  14748440\nDear ACCOUNTS PAYABLE ,\nPlease provide payment status on the below listed invoices.  If payment has been\nmade, please provide details such a check#, amount, date sent.  If there are\nproblems on them that need to be addressed, please let me know so I can attend to it\nimmediately.\nInvoice No. Purchase\nOrder Number\nBalance Due Inv Date Due Date DBT\n15455556 15447737\n58979\n$-1,312.08 08/28/2026 08/28/2026     20\n15398467 58594 $774.00 07/06/2026 09/04/2026     13\n15398891 58051 $365.77 07/07/2026 09/05/2026     12\n15399796 58600 $1,105.78 07/07/2026 09/05/2026     12\n15400210 58284 $3,026.56 07/08/2026 09/06/2026     11\n15401860 58610 $804.19 07/09/2026 09/07/2026     10\n15402415 58618 $8,756.14 07/09/2026 09/07/2026     10\n15402927 58421 $2,772.90 07/10/2026 09/08/2026      9\n15403449 58641 $380.36 07/10/2026 09/08/2026      9\n\n15464367 15439109\n58912\n$-638.88 09/08/2026 09/08/2026      9\n15406239 58653 $7,901.12 07/14/2026 09/12/2026      5\n15407157 58499 $6,785.00 07/15/2026 09/13/2026      4\n15408130 58676 $9,699.02 07/15/2026 09/13/2026      4\n15409280 58648 $2,318.",
