    "document_class": "letter",
    "text_excerpt": "September 23, 2026\nKANNON MANUFACTURING INC\n5129 VESTA FARLEY RD\nFORT WORTH, TX 76119\nRegarding Account #:  14748440\nATTENTION: ACCOUNTING DEPARTMENT - PENDING ORDERS\nOrder # PO # Request Date Order Value\n22961598 59200 09/21/2026 $323.94\n22962893 59251 09/22/2026 $3,012.19\n22962970 59253 09/22/2026 $16,386.88\nWe would like to take this opportunity to thank you for choosing O'Neal Steel LLC.  As a\nvalued customer we do want to work with you in releasing the order(s) pending.  If you\ncould please provide payment status of the below invoices. \nFor your convenience all open invoice, credit memos and proof of deliveries can be found on\nour PRONTO\u00ae customer portal.  If you would like access to this site, please advise and we\nwill have you set up.\nInvoice No. Purchase Order\nNumber\nBalance Due Inv Date Due Date DBT\n15406239 - 001 58653 $7,901.12 07/14/2026 09/12/2026     11\n15408130 - 001 58676 $9,699.02 07/15/2026 09/13/2026     10\n15407157 - 001 58499 $6,785.00 07/15/2026 09/13/2026     10\n15409416 - 001 58688 $79.94 07/16/2026 09/14/2026      9\n15409280 - 001 58648 $2,318.91 07/16/2026 09/14/2026      9\n15411914 - 001 58705 $6,288.75 07/20/2026 09/18/2026      5\n15412969 - 001 58584 $7",
    "document_basis": "2026-09-23 O'Neal letter for account 14748440. Heading is 'ATTENTION: ACCOUNTING DEPARTMENT - PENDING ORDERS' and it asks for payment status of the invoices listed below. Stored invoice number 15478871 is a row on that list, not a vendor invoice. The same list includes 15409416 at a $79.94 balance. Verification $42,079.26 is the letter total. No lines, charges, or taxes were entered."
